  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large wok or skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the toasted Sichuan pepper and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the soy sauce, rice vinegar, and yakimono-grill sauce, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the sauce to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes, or until slightly thickened.",
    "Cook the Sichuan noodles according to the package instructions and drain well.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the sauce and toss to combine.",
    "Stir in the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Transfer the noodles to a serving platter and garnish with thinly sliced scallions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
